-- Money is MAJOR units (pesos) throughout — matches src/actions/orders.ts (no /100).
-- orderNumber uses an IMPORT namespace (HPG-IMP-####) so it never collides with the
-- live orderSeq scheme. clientId = original HP GLOW order UUID (idempotent re-runs).
-- Historical orders: productId is intentionally omitted from items so re-status never
-- moves the new tenant's live inventory. adminFee/courier/tracking left at defaults.

